1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:06,110
- Pasadena City College?
- A place for fun, a place for knowledge.

2
00:00:08,988 --> 00:00:13,198
See, this man here is playing Hacky Sack,
and this girl's gonna be a paralegal.

3
00:00:14,702 --> 00:00:17,492
Oh. I get it,
because Dr. Leonard Hofstadter...

4
00:00:17,664 --> 00:00:20,624
(Penny:)...can't date a girl
without a fancy college degree.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,500
(Leonard:)Well, it's really not that fancy.
It's just a city college.

6
00:00:25,338 --> 00:00:28,178
(Penny:)Right, but I have to have
some sort of degree to date you?

7
00:00:28,341 --> 00:00:32,221
- That doesn't matter to me at all.
- So it's fine with you if I'm not smart?

8
00:00:32,387 --> 00:00:34,637
(Penny:)Absolutely.

9
00:00:39,185 --> 00:00:42,025
(Leonard:)Okay, this time,
I know where I went wrong.

10
00:00:44,691 --> 00:00:46,521
(Leonard:)Bite me.

